---

Third-party data

The locale table in crates/smartformat/src/fmt/culture/generated.rs is not
derived from SmartFormat.NET. It is generated by tools/culturegen, which reads
CultureInfo.NumberFormat and CultureInfo.DateTimeFormat out of a .NET runtime
(MIT licensed, https://github.com/dotnet/runtime). That data is ICU-backed, so
it originates in the Unicode Common Locale Data Repository, distributed under
the Unicode License (https://www.unicode.org/copyright.html).

The plural-rule table in crates/smartformat/src/extensions/plural_rules.rs and
the time-text resources in crates/smartformat/src/extensions/time.rs are ports
of SmartFormat.NET's own Utilities/PluralRules.cs and
SmartFormat.Extensions.Time/Resources/*.json, covered by the copyright above.

